@startuml
title DineFlow - Waiter Use Cases
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #EAF4FF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #3D5368

left to right direction
actor Waiter
rectangle "DineFlow - Waiter" {
 usecase "Receive waiter-call notification\nFR-014; Must" as Receive
 usecase "Acknowledge a call\nP-CALL; proposed" as Ack #FFF4D6
 usecase "Resolve a call\nP-CALL; proposed" as Resolve #FFF4D6
 usecase "View relevant pre-orders\nFR-013; proposed read allocation" as Orders #FFF4D6
}
Waiter -- Receive
Waiter -- Ack
Waiter -- Resolve
Waiter -- Orders
legend bottom
Blue: FR-014; amber: proposed P-CALL workflow / P-STAFF read allocation.
Waiter means the WAITER role in the active restaurant membership.
The same employee may also hold MANAGER; no automatic management rights.
Receipt, acknowledgement and resolution differ; routing/timing remain D-07-D-11.
endlegend
@enduml
